    "en": "Authored offline pixel-art drive along a real Lisbon route baked from OpenStreetMap: buildings on their mapped footprints, code-drawn facades, signs with real names, seven landmarks and a bridge, golden hour into night, a deterministic 90-second film. Facades are drawn by code, not photographs. Silent by design; no runtime model calls.",
